    "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2021 gross claims outstanding were $485.17m. During 2021 the Syndicate recorded a gross increase in prior-year provisions of $24.14m (4.98% of opening reserves) as shown in the technical provisions movement note. Management also describes having undertaken an extensive Q4 review of prior-year loss reserves and reporting favourable improvements that contributed to the closed 2019 Year of Account result; the movement in the technical provisions table reflects adjustments to gross claims and to reinsurers' recoverables. The change is concentrated in catastrophe-exposed property and reinsurance lines with ongoing monitoring of exposure, modelling and reserving assumptions.",
